WEBVTT

00:01.706 --> 00:04.568
[slack-key guitar music]
[松键吉他音乐]

00:04.637 --> 00:09.706
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:09.775 --> 00:11.534
[water bubbles]
[水泡]

00:11.603 --> 00:13.879
- Hmm.
Mm-hmm.
- 唔。
嗯嗯。

00:13.948 --> 00:15.568
Mm-hmm.
[humming]
嗯嗯。
[嗡嗡声]

00:15.637 --> 00:18.568
[accordion music]
[手风琴音乐]

00:18.637 --> 00:20.706
Hmm.
唔。

00:20.775 --> 00:22.500
All right, take this, boyo.
好吧，拿着这个，男孩。

00:22.568 --> 00:25.224
Study it very carefully.
非常仔细地研究它。

00:25.293 --> 00:27.500
- Right--oh, Mr. Krabs.
- 是的 - 哦，蟹老板。

00:27.568 --> 00:28.741
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

00:28.810 --> 00:30.534
- Not that side.
- 不是那一边。

00:30.603 --> 00:32.982
- Oh, ah.
A shopping list?
- 哦，啊。
购物清单？

00:33.051 --> 00:34.913
- We're running low
on secret "ingrederents."
- 我们所剩无几了
关于秘密“成分”。

00:34.982 --> 00:37.086
I need you to go shopping.
我需要你去购物。

00:37.155 --> 00:39.879
But be careful
not to lose the list.
但要小心
不要丢失列表。

00:39.948 --> 00:42.465
If "you know who"
gets his hands on it,
如果“你知道谁”
得到他的手，

00:42.534 --> 00:45.396
he'll know what goes
into the Krabby Patty.
他会知道会发生什么
进入蟹黄馅饼。

00:45.465 --> 00:47.465
And you know where that leads.
你知道这会导致什么结果。

00:47.534 --> 00:51.017
Total apocalypse!
彻底的天启！

00:51.086 --> 00:53.948
- More like "fun-pocalypse."
[laughs]
- 更像是“有趣的末日”。
[笑]

00:54.017 --> 00:55.948
I'll just follow
that yellow nitwit
我就跟着
那个黄白痴

00:56.017 --> 00:58.844
and the secret ingredients
will be mine.
和秘密成分
将是我的。

00:58.913 --> 01:02.431
- [laughing]
- Huh?
- [笑]
- 啊？

01:02.500 --> 01:05.293
[headphones buzzing]
[耳机嗡嗡声]

01:05.362 --> 01:07.913
Ah...
啊...

01:07.982 --> 01:09.775
- ♪ Shopping spree,
that's for me ♪
- ♪ 疯狂购物，
那是给我的 ♪

01:09.844 --> 01:11.568
♪ A list of goodies
from the sea ♪
♪ 好东西清单
来自大海♪

01:11.637 --> 01:13.396
♪ Shopping spree,
that's for me ♪
♪ 疯狂购物，
那是给我的 ♪

01:13.465 --> 01:15.327
♪ A list of goodies
from the sea ♪
♪ 好东西清单
来自大海♪

01:15.396 --> 01:17.327
♪ Shopping spree,
that's for me ♪
♪ 疯狂购物，
那是给我的 ♪

01:17.396 --> 01:19.362
♪ A list of goodies
from the sea ♪
♪ 好东西清单
来自大海♪

01:19.431 --> 01:20.500
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:20.568 --> 01:22.396
- [scatting]
- [分散]

01:22.465 --> 01:25.396
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

01:25.465 --> 01:32.396
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:32.465 --> 01:35.258
[scatting]
[分散]

01:35.327 --> 01:37.362
- [laughs]
- [笑]

01:37.431 --> 01:38.500
Ah?
啊？

01:38.568 --> 01:40.775
Ah!
啊!

01:43.051 --> 01:45.086
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:45.155 --> 01:47.362
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

01:47.431 --> 01:48.775
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:48.844 --> 01:51.051
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

01:52.672 --> 01:55.741
- Wow, the stuff on this
shopping list is pretty exotic.
- 哇，这上面的东西
购物清单很有异国情调。

01:55.810 --> 01:57.810
I'm not gonna find any
of this at Barg 'N' Mart.
我不会找到任何
Barg 'N' Mart 的这个。

01:57.879 --> 02:00.603
[thumps, whirs]
[重击声，呼呼声]

02:00.672 --> 02:02.396
- What you got there,
SpongeBob?
- 你在那里得到了什么，
海绵宝宝？

02:02.465 --> 02:05.258
- [whirring]
Hold on.
- [呼呼]
坚持住。

02:05.327 --> 02:07.568
Something super secret.
一些超级秘密。

02:07.637 --> 02:08.948
- Uh?
- 呃？

02:09.017 --> 02:11.637
- Yeah, I guess
you'd wanna keep this secret.
- 是的，我想
你会想保守这个秘密的。

02:11.706 --> 02:13.120
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

02:13.189 --> 02:16.224
- Not that side.
- Holy moly.
- 不是那一边。
- 圣钼。

02:16.293 --> 02:17.879
You're gonna have
to go to tarnation and back
你将会有
前往塔兰尼并返回

02:17.948 --> 02:19.120
to get all
these things.
得到所有
这些事情。

02:19.189 --> 02:22.017
- What'll I do?
- Eh, no worries.
- 我该怎么办？
- 呃，不用担心。

02:22.086 --> 02:24.775
I just souped up
old Matilda here.
我刚刚加了汤
老玛蒂尔达在这里。

02:26.362 --> 02:28.327
- [purrs]
- [呼噜声]

02:28.396 --> 02:29.706
- I think she likes you.
- 我想她喜欢你。

02:29.775 --> 02:32.224
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

02:32.293 --> 02:34.741
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:34.810 --> 02:36.879
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:39.224 --> 02:42.120
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

02:42.189 --> 02:45.948
Sandy, does it seem
a little dry in here?
桑迪，看来
这里有点干燥吗？

02:47.672 --> 02:49.637
- Huh?
Oh, possum pits!
- 啊？
哦，负鼠坑！

02:49.706 --> 02:51.431
How could I forget?
我怎么能忘记呢？

02:51.500 --> 02:53.362
[valve creaks]
[阀门嘎吱声]

02:53.431 --> 02:56.603
[water whooshes in]
[水呼啸而入]

02:56.672 --> 02:58.327
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

02:58.396 --> 02:59.706
[sighs, chuckles]
[叹气，轻笑]

02:59.775 --> 03:00.706
Thanks.
谢谢。

03:00.775 --> 03:02.465
- Buckle up.
- 系好安全带。

03:02.534 --> 03:05.465
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

03:05.534 --> 03:10.534
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:10.603 --> 03:12.327
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:12.396 --> 03:14.362
What?
Ah!
什么？
啊!

03:14.431 --> 03:17.224
[tools clinking]
[工具叮当作响]

03:17.293 --> 03:18.534
Phew.
唷。

03:18.603 --> 03:20.120
Ah!
啊!

03:20.189 --> 03:22.568
[screams]
[尖叫声]

03:22.637 --> 03:25.362
[moans]
[呻吟声]

03:25.431 --> 03:27.913
- The first item
on Mr. Krabs' list is...
- 第一项
蟹老板的名单上有……

03:27.982 --> 03:30.155
hair from a yeti crab?
雪人蟹的毛发？

03:30.224 --> 03:32.500
- Well, that hairy hermit
dwells right here
- 嗯，那个毛茸茸的隐士
就住在这里

03:32.568 --> 03:34.224
on this mountaintop.
在这座山顶上。

03:34.293 --> 03:35.810
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

03:35.879 --> 03:37.431
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

03:37.500 --> 03:38.603
Look, there he is.
看，他就在那里。

03:38.672 --> 03:40.741
[dramatic musical flourish]
【戏剧性的音乐盛宴】

03:40.810 --> 03:43.741
[sneaky music]
[偷偷摸摸的音乐]

03:43.810 --> 03:48.051
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:48.120 --> 03:50.603
He lives alone.
He'll never know it's gone.
他一个人住。
他永远不会知道它已经消失了。

03:50.672 --> 03:54.741
- Krabs puts yeti hair
in the Krabby Patties?
- 螃蟹放上雪人的头发
在蟹黄肉饼里？

03:54.810 --> 03:56.465
Ew.
呃。

03:56.534 --> 03:57.913
Why didn't I think of that?
为什么我没有想到这一点？

03:57.982 --> 03:59.396
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:59.465 --> 04:01.327
[teeth rattle]
[牙齿嘎嘎作响]

04:01.396 --> 04:04.844
[snoring]
[打鼾]

04:04.913 --> 04:06.500
- Ah.
- 啊。

04:06.568 --> 04:07.741
[lawnmower engine starts]
[割草机发动机启动]

04:07.810 --> 04:09.948
[laughs]
[笑]

04:10.017 --> 04:12.844
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

04:12.913 --> 04:15.672
[roars]
[怒吼]

04:15.741 --> 04:17.948
Huh?
啊？

04:19.431 --> 04:20.637
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

04:20.706 --> 04:22.431
Ow!
噢！

04:22.500 --> 04:23.775
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:23.844 --> 04:25.948
Whoa, hey.
哇，嘿。

04:26.017 --> 04:28.568
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:28.637 --> 04:29.913
Could've been worse.
情况可能会更糟。

04:29.982 --> 04:33.637
Could've been a ten-gallon hat.
可能是一顶十加仑的帽子。

04:33.706 --> 04:37.603
- The next item is milk
from a giant fang-tooth fish.
- 下一个项目是牛奶
来自巨型尖牙鱼。

04:37.672 --> 04:41.879
- The deep ocean floor
is the only place it inhabits.
- 深海海底
是它唯一栖息的地方。

04:41.948 --> 04:44.258
Keep an eye out.
请留意。

04:48.258 --> 04:49.603
Ooh.
哦。

04:49.672 --> 04:52.086
Eye--found it.
眼睛——发现了。

04:55.051 --> 04:56.362
But how do we milk it?
但我们如何挤奶呢？

04:56.431 --> 04:58.293
- We'll have
to distract her first.
- 我们会有
首先分散她的注意力。

04:58.362 --> 04:59.844
Deploy kibble!
部署粗磨！

04:59.913 --> 05:02.844
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

05:02.913 --> 05:07.844
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:10.706 --> 05:12.155
- Whoa.
Huh?
- 哇哦。
啊？

05:12.224 --> 05:14.155
- Is one utter better
than another utter?
- 有一个更好吗
比另一个完全？

05:14.224 --> 05:17.017
- We'll just have
to milk 'em all.
- 我们只要
挤榨他们所有人。

05:17.086 --> 05:18.879
[bluegrass music]
[蓝草音乐]

05:18.948 --> 05:20.603
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

05:20.672 --> 05:22.258
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:22.327 --> 05:24.810
- Ooh, ah.
- 哦，啊。

05:24.879 --> 05:30.948
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:31.017 --> 05:32.982
Doy.
- Whoo nelly.
多伊。
- 哇内莉。

05:33.051 --> 05:35.431
Good girl.
好女孩。

05:35.500 --> 05:37.362
- [moos]
- [哞哞]

05:40.948 --> 05:44.258
- [laughing]
- [笑]

05:44.327 --> 05:47.396
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:47.465 --> 05:49.017
Uh?
呃？

05:49.086 --> 05:52.431
Don't you run dry on me, baby.
别让你对我失去兴趣，宝贝。

05:52.500 --> 05:53.637
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

05:53.706 --> 05:56.396
- Come on, flow already.
- 来吧，已经流动了。

05:56.465 --> 05:59.327
- [growling]
- Nice fishy, fishy.
- [咆哮]
- 好鱼，鱼。

05:59.396 --> 06:01.913
Uh, I don't suppose
you like Chumsicles.
呃，我不认为
你喜欢 Chumsicles。

06:01.982 --> 06:04.568
[laughs nervously]
[紧张地笑]

06:04.637 --> 06:07.913
[slack-key guitar music]
[松键吉他音乐]

06:07.982 --> 06:09.534
- [gargles]
- [漱口]

06:09.603 --> 06:10.810
[chuckles]
Yeah.
[笑声]
是的。

06:10.879 --> 06:13.431
Thanks for the fish milk, ugly.
谢谢你的鱼奶，丑。

06:13.500 --> 06:14.637
[laughs]
[笑]

06:14.706 --> 06:16.120
Ah!
啊!

06:16.189 --> 06:18.086
- You're not ugly, darling.
- 你并不丑，亲爱的。

06:18.155 --> 06:19.844
You've got character.
你有性格。

06:19.913 --> 06:23.637
- Aw.
[giggles]
- 噢。
[咯咯笑]

06:23.706 --> 06:25.327
- Oh, shrimp.
- 哦，虾。

06:25.396 --> 06:29.672
Guess I'll have to take
the long walk to the back exit.
我想我必须采取
到后出口的长途步行。

06:29.741 --> 06:32.258
- SpongeBob,
what're we doing here?
- 海绵宝宝，
我们在这里做什么？

06:32.327 --> 06:34.086
The Flying Dutchman
is about as welcoming
飞翔的荷兰人号
也同样热情

06:34.155 --> 06:35.637
as an outhouse breeze.
就像室外的微风一样。

06:35.706 --> 06:37.189
- It's on the list.
- 它在名单上。

06:37.258 --> 06:39.086
See?
Ghost dandruff.
看？
幽灵头皮屑。

06:39.155 --> 06:42.913
- [maniacal laugh]
- [疯狂的笑声]

06:42.982 --> 06:47.810
With my face I can say anything
and make it sound scary.
用我的脸我可以说什么
并让它听起来很可怕。

06:47.879 --> 06:49.568
[laughs]
[笑]

06:49.637 --> 06:53.913
One large skinny pumpkin latte
with soy milk, please.
一大杯瘦南瓜拿铁
请加豆浆。

06:53.982 --> 06:56.706
[laughs]
[笑]

06:56.775 --> 06:59.362
[chainsaw roars]
[电锯咆哮]

06:59.431 --> 07:02.568
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

07:02.637 --> 07:03.706
Argh.
啊。

07:03.775 --> 07:05.844
40% chance of rain tonight
今晚有 40% 的机会下雨

07:05.913 --> 07:09.810
as we head into the weekend.
当我们进入周末时。

07:09.879 --> 07:14.017
[laughing]
[笑]

07:14.086 --> 07:19.568
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:19.637 --> 07:23.293
[laughing]
[笑]

07:23.362 --> 07:26.224
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

07:26.293 --> 07:27.431
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:27.500 --> 07:30.844
- [laughs]
[vacuum whooshes]
- [笑]
[真空嘶嘶声]

07:30.913 --> 07:32.637
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:32.706 --> 07:33.637
What the--
什么是——

07:33.706 --> 07:37.017
How dare you steal my dandruff?
你怎么敢偷我的头皮屑？

07:37.086 --> 07:40.534
I've been drying me scalp
for centuries
我已经把头皮擦干了
几个世纪以来

07:40.603 --> 07:44.568
in order to achieve
the perfect dermatitis flakes.
为了达到
完美的皮炎片。

07:44.637 --> 07:46.189
[harp music]
[竖琴音乐]

07:46.258 --> 07:48.844
- Maybe some
Skull & Shoulders would help?
- 也许有一些
骷髅肩有帮助吗？

07:48.913 --> 07:50.706
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:53.603 --> 07:55.913
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:55.982 --> 07:58.568
[heroic music]
[英雄音乐]

07:58.637 --> 08:00.534
- Well, we got
everything on the list.
- 好吧，我们得到了
清单上的所有内容。

08:00.603 --> 08:01.637
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:01.706 --> 08:03.810
Oh, Mr. Krabs
will be so proud of me.
哦，蟹老板
将会为我感到骄傲。

08:03.879 --> 08:06.396
- I hope so, because
that's the craziest group
- 我希望如此，因为
这是最疯狂的一群

08:06.465 --> 08:07.775
of ingredients I ever--
我曾经的成分——

08:07.844 --> 08:09.051
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

08:09.120 --> 08:11.155
both: [yelping]
两人：[尖叫]

08:11.224 --> 08:14.189
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

08:14.258 --> 08:16.120
- There was one more thing
I needed to get
- 还有一件事
我需要得到

08:16.189 --> 08:17.948
on my shopping list.
在我的购物清单上。

08:18.017 --> 08:19.500
Everything.
一切。

08:19.568 --> 08:22.258
[chuckles]
Thanks for doing it for me.
[笑声]
谢谢你为我做这件事。

08:22.327 --> 08:26.603
So long, chumps.
both: [yelp]
再见，笨蛋。
两者：[尖叫]

08:26.672 --> 08:29.051
- [maniacal laugh]
- [疯狂的笑声]

08:29.120 --> 08:30.706
At last.
终于。

08:30.775 --> 08:35.534
The Krabby Patty secret
ingredients are in my hands.
蟹黄派蒂的秘密
配料在我手里。

08:35.603 --> 08:38.603
both: Ahhhhh!
两人：啊啊啊！

08:38.672 --> 08:40.913
- Aw, my ingredients.
- 哦，我的配料。

08:40.982 --> 08:43.672
- My submarine.
- 我的潜艇。

08:43.741 --> 08:44.844
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:44.913 --> 08:46.465
My hair!
我的头发！

08:46.534 --> 08:47.672
both: Ah!
两人：啊！

08:47.741 --> 08:49.534
[in French accent]
- Later...
[法语口音]
- 后来...

08:49.603 --> 08:52.741
[slack-key guitar music]
- [snorting]
[松键吉他音乐]
- [哼哼]

08:52.810 --> 08:53.775
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:53.844 --> 08:56.396
- Thanks for the wig.
- 谢谢你的假发。

08:56.465 --> 09:00.741
- No problem.
It'll grow back.
- 没问题。
它会重新长出来。

09:00.810 --> 09:02.948
- And you even had enough
to cover his buns.
- 你甚至受够了
盖住他的面包。

09:03.017 --> 09:04.534
- [joyful panting]
- [快乐的气喘吁吁]

09:04.603 --> 09:07.017
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:07.086 --> 09:08.672
- Oh, Mr. Krabs...
- [shrieks]
- 哦，蟹老板...
- [尖叫]

09:08.741 --> 09:10.431
- ...I got all those secret
ingredients on your list,
- ...我得到了所有这些秘密
你清单上的成分，

09:10.500 --> 09:12.810
but Plankton stole them all.
但浮游生物把它们全部偷走了。

09:12.879 --> 09:15.810
I made the apocalypse.
我创造了世界末日。

09:15.879 --> 09:17.051
[sobs]
[抽泣]

09:17.120 --> 09:19.603
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

09:19.672 --> 09:21.293
Now, now, son.
现在，现在，儿子。

09:21.362 --> 09:23.741
You didn't make
the apocalypse.
你没有做到
启示录。

09:23.810 --> 09:26.086
I couldn't afford to have
Plankton following me
我买不起
浮游生物跟着我

09:26.155 --> 09:28.086
while I was getting
the real ingredients
当我得到
真正的成分

09:28.155 --> 09:30.500
at the Barg 'N' Mart,
could I?
在 Barg 'N' Mart，
我可以吗？

09:30.568 --> 09:32.431
- Whoa.
My leg!
- 哇哦。
我的腿！

09:32.500 --> 09:34.775
- Wait, so, my list was a fake?
- 等等，所以，我的名单是假的？

09:34.844 --> 09:36.327
So no apocalypse?
那么没有启示录吗？

09:36.396 --> 09:38.051
- No-pocalypse.
- 没有末日。

09:38.120 --> 09:40.120
- I saved the world.
- 我拯救了世界。

09:40.189 --> 09:41.224
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

09:41.293 --> 09:42.810
♪ No apocalypse ♪
♪ 没有末日 ♪

09:42.879 --> 09:44.327
♪ No apocalypse ♪
♪ 没有末日 ♪

09:44.396 --> 09:45.948
♪ No apocalypse ♪
♪ 没有末日 ♪

09:46.017 --> 09:47.741
♪ No apocalypse ♪
♪ 没有末日 ♪

09:47.810 --> 09:49.189
- Let's not go too far.
- 我们不要走得太远。

09:49.258 --> 09:52.224
- You mean
you sent my best friend
- 你的意思是
你派了我最好的朋友

09:52.293 --> 09:54.155
on a dangerous wild
goose-chase
在危险的荒野上
追鹅

09:54.224 --> 09:56.362
just so you could go shopping?
只是为了让你可以去购物？

09:56.431 --> 09:59.362
Excuse us, SpongeBob.
对不起，海绵宝宝。

09:59.431 --> 10:01.086
This is for my tail.
- Wait, Sandy, I would--
这是给我的尾巴的。
- 等等，桑迪，我会——

10:01.155 --> 10:02.396
- Hyah!
- [grunts]
- 哈！
- [咕哝]

10:02.465 --> 10:05.224
- This is for almost
getting us killed.
- 这几乎是为了
让我们被杀。

10:05.293 --> 10:06.948
Hyah!
- Wait, Sandy--oh!
哈！
- 等等，桑迪——哦！

10:07.017 --> 10:08.500
Doy.
多伊。

10:08.568 --> 10:12.500
- And this is
for my submarine Matilda.
- 这是
为我的潜艇玛蒂尔达。

10:12.568 --> 10:16.224
[disoriented mumbling]
[迷失方向的咕哝]

10:16.293 --> 10:17.913
- Hyah!
Hyah!
- 哈！
哈！

10:17.982 --> 10:21.500
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

10:21.568 --> 10:25.982
Well, I guess
I had that coming.
嗯，我猜
我本来就是这样的。

10:26.051 --> 10:27.741
- Can you believe it, Karen?
- 你能相信吗，凯伦？

10:27.810 --> 10:30.775
After all these years,
the secret ingredients
这么多年过去了，
秘密成分

10:30.844 --> 10:32.258
are finally here.
终于来了。

10:32.327 --> 10:36.189
And the final ingredient,
ghost dandruff.
最后的成分，
幽灵头皮屑。

10:36.258 --> 10:39.189
- I wouldn't add that last one.
- 我不会添加最后一项。

10:39.258 --> 10:40.603
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

10:40.672 --> 10:44.465
I can't wait to see
the look on Krabs' face.
我等不及要看
蟹老板脸上的表情。

10:44.534 --> 10:48.534
[explosion booms]
[screams]
[爆炸声]
[尖叫声]

10:48.603 --> 10:49.844
Krabs.
螃蟹。

10:49.913 --> 10:52.534
Plankton.
浮游生物。

10:54.603 --> 10:57.810
[slack-key guitar music]
[松键吉他音乐]

[松键吉他音乐]